CpMackeyFunctors -- for Cp-Mackey functor computations
******************************************************

Description
===========

This Macaulay2 package implements basic homological algebra for Mackey functors
of a cyclic group $C_p$ of prime order. Some highlights of our functionality
include:

  * free *note resolutions: freeResolution_lpCpMackeyFunctor_cmZZ_rp, of
    $C_p$-Mackey functors
  * *note Ext: Ext, and *note Tor: Tor, computations for (cohomological) Mackey
    functors
  * the *note box product: boxProduct, and *note internal hom: internalHom,
  * *note constructions: constructing examples of Mackey functors, of various
    common examples of Mackey functors
  * the ability to generate *note random Mackey functors:
    makeRandomCpMackeyFunctor, over $C_p$
  * *note explicit examples: explicit applications of the CpMackeyFunctors
    package, from the equivariant algebra literature



